{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123357","id":4492801850,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC8q3Og","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123357","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123357.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123357.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123357","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123357/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123357/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123357/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/784964f99a241b3d1493d88df9224ebcc520d5e9","number":123357,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add `\\n` to doc comments on empty line","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #111252.\r\n- Addresses pain point with the new admonition tags (see godotengine/godot-proposals#15493)\r\n- Potentially makes #123353 redundant (if you're adding an empty line before admonitions).\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nDocumentation comments in GDScript join all lines with a space, which makes it easy to write longer sentences. At the same time, a few tags such as `[codeblock]` and `[br]` remove that space and add `\\n` instead. But `[br]` is a bit different, as it only adds `\\n` if two consecutive tags are found (`[br][br]`, or `[br]` on one line and the next starts with `[br]`); a single `[br]` tag only adds `\\r`.\r\n\r\nMaking a new paragraph requires two `[br]` tags, which takes up space in the comments and degrades readability. This PR adds support for empty comment lines to act as a paragraph break:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nclass_name DocCommentTest\r\nextends Node\r\n## Doc comment test\r\n##\r\n## Standard class description, separated from the \"brief description\" with\r\n## a single empty line.\r\n##\r\n## This paragraph comes after another single empty line, instead of being appended\r\n## to the previous paragraph with a space.[br][br]\r\n## The previous paragraph ends with [code skip-lint][br][br][/code], which makes\r\n## this line a new paragraph.\r\n##\r\n## [note]Empty line paragraph breaks also work with admonitions.[/note]\r\n```\r\ndisplays as:\r\n| | |\r\n|-|-|\r\n| master | <img width=\"1090\" height=\"150\" alt=\"master_1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6205cae3-6b3e-479e-b8bc-22570af957ea\" /> |\r\n| This PR | <img width=\"940\" height=\"174\" alt=\"paragraph_break_1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e3ac44e6-319d-4d93-b9a9-a4184d99f524\" /> |\r\n\r\nMultiple empty lines still only add a single `\\n`:\r\n```gdscript\r\n## Testing empty lines as paragraph breaks.\r\n## No empty line.\r\n##\r\n## After a single empty line.\r\n##\r\n##\r\n## After two empty lines.\r\n##\r\n##\r\n##\r\n## After three empty lines.\r\nfunc doc_comment() -> void:\r\n```\r\ndisplays as:\r\n| | |\r\n|-|-|\r\n| master | <img width=\"1050\" height=\"70\" alt=\"master_2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ddc7bb02-b1c6-4be3-9f88-3d7f63cd5aa2\" /> (note the increasing number of spaces) |\r\n| This PR | <img width=\"484\" height=\"174\" alt=\"paragraph_break_2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1e96fc4c-6c74-4360-91ff-d443d4e157f7\" /> |\r\n\r\nWith `godot --doctool --gdscript-docs`, this results in the following XML file:\r\n```xml\r\n<class name=\"DocCommentTest\" inherits=\"Node\" xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot/master/doc/class.xsd\">\r\n\t<brief_description>\r\n\t\tDoc comment test\r\n\t</brief_description>\r\n\t<description>\r\n\t\tStandard class description, separated from the \"brief description\" with a single empty line.\r\nThis paragraph comes after another single empty line, instead of being appended to the previous paragraph with a space.\r\nThe previous paragraph ends with [code skip-lint][br][br][/code], which makes this line a new paragraph.\r\n[note]Empty line paragraph breaks also work with admonitions.\r\n\t</description>\r\n\t<tutorials>\r\n\t</tutorials>\r\n\t<methods>\r\n\t\t<method name=\"doc_comment\">\r\n\t\t\t<return type=\"void\" />\r\n\t\t\t<description>\r\n\t\t\t\tTesting empty lines as paragraph breaks. No empty line.\r\nAfter a single empty line.\r\nAfter two empty lines.\r\nAfter three empty lines.\r\n\t\t\t</description>\r\n\t\t</method>\r\n\t</methods>\r\n</class>\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issue